---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Capítulo 07: Plan de Gestión del Cronograma">
  <style>
    .hero-card, .section-card, .note-card, .list-panel { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 24px; padding: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 1.6rem; box-shadow: 0 22px 48px rgba(15,23,42,.09); }
    .hero-card { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #eff6ff 0%, #f8fbff 100%); border-color: #c7d2fe; }
    .hero-card h2 { margin: 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: .02em; }
    .hero-card .meta-grid { display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr)); margin-top: 1.25rem; }
    .hero-card .meta-item { background: #f8fbff; border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 16px; padding: 1rem; }
    .hero-card .meta-item strong { display: block; color: #2563eb; font-size: .78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
    .hero-card .meta-item span { color: #0f172a; font-size: .96rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .section-card h3, .list-panel h3 { margin-top: 0; color: #1e3a8a; }
    .section-card p, .section-card ul, .section-card ol { color: #334155; line-height: 1.75; margin: .85rem 0; }
    .section-card ul, .section-card ol { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
    .section-card hr { border: 0; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #93c5fd, transparent); margin: 1.5rem 0; }
    .note-card { border-color: #d0e8ff; background: #eef6ff; }
    .note-card strong { display: block; color: #1e40af; margin-bottom: .4rem; }
    .note-grid { display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr)); }
    .chapter-toolbar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .9rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .ct-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: .85rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(15,23,42,.14); background: #fff; color: #1e3a8a; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; transition: transform .18s ease, background .18s ease, border-color .18s ease; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(15,23,42,.08); }
    .ct-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); background: #e0e7ff; border-color: #93c5fd; }
    .ct-btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#1d4ed8,#2563eb); color: #fff; border-color: transparent; }
    .artifact-grid { display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr)); margin: 1.25rem 0 1.5rem; }
    .artifact-card { background: #f8fbff; border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 18px; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; }
    .artifact-card strong { display: block; color: #1d4ed8; margin-bottom: .35rem; font-size: .82rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .artifact-card span { display: block; color: #0f172a; line-height: 1.7; }
    .guidance-group { display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr)); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .guidance-card { border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 18px; background: #eff6ff; padding: 1.2rem; }
    .guidance-card strong { display: block; margin-bottom: .55rem; color: #1e3a8a; }
    .activity-list { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
    .activity-note { background: #f8fbff; border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 18px; padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem; }
    .activity-note strong { display: block; margin-bottom: .6rem; color: #1e3a8a; }
    .activity-note ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; color: #334155; line-height: 1.7; }
    .activity-grid { display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .activity-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .85rem; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 20px; padding: 1.2rem; box-shadow: 0 18px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.06); }
    .activity-card-header { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: .85rem; }
    .activity-number { font-weight: 700; color: #1e3a8a; font-size: .98rem; }
    .activity-code { font-size: .95rem; padding: .35rem .8rem; background: #eef2ff; border-radius: 999px; color: #2563eb; }
    .activity-card h4 { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; color: #0f172a; line-height: 1.4; }
    .activity-meta { display: grid; gap: .45rem; margin-top: .9rem; padding-top: .9rem; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    .activity-meta span { color: #475569; font-size: .94rem; }
    .activity-meta strong { color: #1e3a8a; }
    .activity-grid .activity-card:nth-child(odd) { background: #f8fbff; }
    .list-panel { border-color: #c7d2fe; }
    .list-panel h2 { margin-top: 0; color: #1e3a8a; }
    .list-panel .list-meta { display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr)); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .list-panel .list-meta div { background: #f8fbff; border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 16px; padding: 1rem; }
    .list-panel .list-meta div strong { display: block; color: #1e40af; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
    @media (max-width: 900px) { .activity-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    /* ── INTRO HERO ── */
    .intro-hero { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#1e3a8a 0%,#1d4ed8 50%,#2563eb 100%); border-radius: 24px; padding: 2.2rem 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.6rem; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 28px 56px rgba(15,23,42,.18); }
    .intro-hero h2 { margin: 0 0 .5rem; font-size: 1.85rem; color: #fff; }
    .intro-hero .ih-sub { color: #bfdbfe; font-size: .95rem; margin: 0 0 1.4rem; }
    .intro-hero .ih-grid { display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr)); }
    .intro-hero .ih-card { background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); backdrop-filter: blur(6px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); border-radius: 18px; padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem; }
    .intro-hero .ih-card strong { display: block; color: #93c5fd; font-size: .78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
    .intro-hero .ih-card p { margin: 0; font-size: .9rem; color: #e0f2fe; line-height: 1.65; }

    /* ── SECTION HEADERS ── */
    .sec-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; margin: 2.2rem 0 1.2rem; }
    .sec-header .sec-num { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #dbeafe; line-height: 1; }
    .sec-header h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.4rem; color: #1e3a8a; }

    /* ── ENTRADA CARDS ── */
    .entrada-grid { display: grid; gap: 1.1rem; }
    .entrada-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 20px; padding: 1.3rem 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(15,23,42,.06); }
    .entrada-card .en-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1d4ed8; background: #dbeafe; border-radius: 999px; padding: .2rem .65rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; margin-bottom: .6rem; }
    .entrada-card h4 { margin: 0 0 .55rem; color: #0f172a; font-size: 1rem; }
    .entrada-card p { margin: 0 0 .6rem; color: #475569; font-size: .93rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .entrada-card ul { margin: .5rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.15rem; color: #475569; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.7; }

    /* ── TECNICA CARDS ── */
    .tecnica-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 20px; padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(15,23,42,.06); }
    .tecnica-card .tc-badge { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#1d4ed8,#2563eb); color: #fff; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 999px; padding: .25rem .7rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; margin-bottom: .7rem; }
    .tecnica-card h4 { margin: 0 0 .55rem; color: #1e3a8a; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .tecnica-card p { margin: 0 0 .6rem; color: #334155; line-height: 1.75; }
    .tecnica-card ul { margin: .5rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.15rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.7; }
    .tecnica-result { display: inline-block; background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; border-radius: 10px; padding: .5rem 1rem; font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: .75rem; }

    /* ── CALENDARIO CARD ── */
    .calendar-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#f0f9ff,#eff6ff); border: 1px solid #bae6fd; border-radius: 20px; padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }
    .calendar-card h4 { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #0369a1; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .holiday-list { display: grid; gap: .5rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr)); margin-top: .75rem; }
    .holiday-item { display: flex; gap: .65rem; align-items: flex-start; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #bae6fd; border-radius: 12px; padding: .6rem .9rem; }
    .holiday-date { font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0369a1; white-space: nowrap; }
    .holiday-name { font-size: .88rem; color: #334155; }

    /* ── RUTA CRÍTICA ── */
    .critical-path { background: #fff; border: 2px solid #ef4444; border-radius: 20px; padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(239,68,68,.12); }
    .critical-path h4 { margin: 0 0 .75rem; color: #b91c1c; font-size: 1.05rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; }
    .critical-path p { margin: 0 0 .85rem; color: #334155; line-height: 1.7; }
    .cp-flow { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .4rem; align-items: center; margin-top: .75rem; }
    .cp-step { background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fca5a5; border-radius: 8px; padding: .3rem .65rem; font-size: .82rem; color: #991b1b; font-weight: 600; }
    .cp-arrow { color: #ef4444; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; }
    .cp-gate { background: #ef4444; color: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: .3rem .7rem; font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 700; }

    /* ── HOLGURA TABLE ── */
    .holgura-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: .75rem; font-size: .88rem; }
    .holgura-table th { background: #eff6ff; color: #1e3a8a; padding: .5rem .75rem; text-align: left; font-size: .8rem; border-bottom: 2px solid #dbeafe; }
    .holgura-table td { padding: .45rem .75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; color: #334155; }
    .holgura-table tr:hover td { background: #f8fbff; }
    .holgura-id { font-weight: 700; color: #2563eb; }
    .holgura-days { font-weight: 700; color: #16a34a; }

    /* ── GATE CARDS ── */
    .gates-grid { display: grid; gap: 1.2rem; }
    .gate-card { border-radius: 22px; padding: 1.5rem 1.6rem; box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(15,23,42,.1); }
    .gate-1 { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#f0f9ff,#e0f2fe); border: 2px solid #0ea5e9; }
    .gate-2 { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7); border: 2px solid #22c55e; }
    .gate-3 { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#fdf4ff,#f3e8ff); border: 2px solid #a855f7; }
    .gate-card .gate-title { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .gate-card .gate-diamond { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    .gate-card h4 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .gate-1 h4 { color: #0369a1; }
    .gate-2 h4 { color: #15803d; }
    .gate-3 h4 { color: #7e22ce; }
    .gate-card .gate-criteria { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: .45rem; }
    .gate-card .gate-criteria li { display: flex; gap: .6rem; align-items: flex-start; font-size: .9rem; color: #334155; line-height: 1.55; }
    .gate-card .gate-criteria li .chk { flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 1rem; }
    .gate-1 .chk { color: #0ea5e9; }
    .gate-2 .chk { color: #22c55e; }
    .gate-3 .chk { color: #a855f7; }
    .gate-card .gate-firmantes { margin-top: 1rem; padding-top: .75rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08); font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .gate-1 .gate-firmantes { color: #0369a1; }
    .gate-2 .gate-firmantes { color: #15803d; }
    .gate-3 .gate-firmantes { color: #7e22ce; }

    /* ── CONTROL SECTION ── */
    .control-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 22px; padding: 1.5rem 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(15,23,42,.08); }
    .control-card h4 { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #1e3a8a; font-size: 1.08rem; border-bottom: 2px solid #dbeafe; padding-bottom: .65rem; }
    .evm-grid { display: grid; gap: .85rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr)); margin: .75rem 0 1rem; }
    .evm-item { background: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 14px; padding: .9rem 1rem; }
    .evm-item .evm-formula { font-family: monospace; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1e3a8a; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
    .evm-item .evm-desc { font-size: .85rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.55; }
    .alert-box { border-radius: 14px; padding: .85rem 1rem; font-size: .9rem; margin: .5rem 0; display: flex; gap: .6rem; align-items: flex-start; }
    .alert-warning { background: #fefce8; border: 1px solid #fde047; color: #713f12; }
    .alert-danger  { background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fca5a5; color: #7f1d1d; }
    .alert-box .alert-icon { font-size: 1.1rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .proceso-steps { list-style: none; margin: .75rem 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: .6rem; }
    .proceso-steps li { display: flex; gap: .75rem; align-items: flex-start; font-size: .91rem; color: #334155; line-height: 1.6; }
    .step-num { flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #1d4ed8; color: #fff; border-radius: 50%; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-top: .1rem; }
    .reservas-grid { display: grid; gap: .85rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr)); margin-top: 1rem; }
    .reserva-item { border-radius: 14px; padding: 1rem; text-align: center; }
    .reserva-cont { background: #fef9c3; border: 1px solid #fde047; }
    .reserva-gest { background: #f0f9ff; border: 1px solid #7dd3fc; }
    .reserva-max  { background: #fdf4ff; border: 1px solid #d8b4fe; }
    .reserva-item strong { display: block; font-size: .75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
    .reserva-cont strong { color: #713f12; }
    .reserva-gest strong { color: #075985; }
    .reserva-max  strong { color: #6b21a8; }
    .reserva-item .rv-val { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; display: block; margin-bottom: .2rem; }
    .reserva-cont .rv-val { color: #92400e; }
    .reserva-gest .rv-val { color: #0369a1; }
    .reserva-max  .rv-val { color: #7e22ce; }
    .reserva-item .rv-note { font-size: .82rem; color: #64748b; }

    /* Gantt wrapper spacing */
    .gantt-section { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  </style>

  <section class="sec" id="capitulo7">

    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         HERO PRINCIPAL
    ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <div class="hero-card" id="plan">
      <h2>PLAN DE GESTIÓN DEL CRONOGRAMA</h2>
      <div class="meta-grid">
        <div class="meta-item"><strong>Proyecto</strong><span>Transformación Digital Roma Bag's</span></div>
        <div class="meta-item"><strong>Versión</strong><span>1.0</span></div>
        <div class="meta-item"><strong>Fecha</strong><span>Julio 2026</span></div>
        <div class="meta-item"><strong>Elaborado por</strong><span>Equipo Consultor UNTELS</span></div>
        <div class="meta-item"><strong>Aprobado por</strong><span>Líder del Proyecto</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- BARRA DE NAVEGACIÓN RÁPIDA -->
    <div class="chapter-toolbar">
      <a href="/capitulo7"             class="ct-btn">7.0 Plan</a>
      <a href="/capitulo7/entradas"     class="ct-btn">7.1 Entradas</a>
      <a href="/capitulo7/herramientas" class="ct-btn">7.2 Herramientas</a>
      <a href="/capitulo7/salidas"      class="ct-btn">7.3 Salidas</a>
      <a href="/capitulo7/control"      class="ct-btn">7.4 Control</a>
      <a href="/capitulo7/lista"        class="ct-btn ct-btn-primary">Lista de Actividades</a>
    </div>

    <div class="list-panel" id="lista">
      <h2>LISTA DE ACTIVIDADES DEL EDT</h2>
      <div class="artifact-grid">
        <div class="artifact-card"><strong>Área de conocimiento</strong><span>Gestión del Cronograma</span></div>
        <div class="artifact-card"><strong>Proceso</strong><span>Definir las Actividades</span></div>
        <div class="artifact-card"><strong>Dominio</strong><span>Planificación (PMBOK 8)</span></div>
        <div class="artifact-card"><strong>Artefacto</strong><span>Lista de Actividades para MS Project</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="guidance-group">
        <div class="guidance-card"><strong>Fundamento</strong><p>La Lista de Actividades traduce cada paquete de trabajo de la EDT en acciones concretas y ejecutables. La EDT usa sustantivos (entregables); la Lista de Actividades usa verbos (acciones). Cada actividad contiene identificador, descripción, duración y predecesoras que definen la secuencia lógica.</p></div>
        <div class="guidance-card"><strong>Instrucción para MS Project</strong><p>Crea las tareas en el mismo orden numérico. Marca las tareas resumen con RESUMEN. Usa el número de fila como predecesora, separa múltiples predecesoras con coma y modela los hitos como duración 0.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="list-meta">
        <div><strong>Proyecto</strong> Transformación Digital Roma Bag's</div>
        <div><strong>Fecha de inicio</strong> Lunes 31 de agosto de 2026</div>
        <div><strong>Duración estimada</strong> 75 días hábiles</div>
        <div><strong>Cierre estimado</strong> Martes 15 de diciembre de 2026</div>
      </div>
      <div class="activity-list">
        <div class="activity-note">
          <strong>FERIADOS A CONFIGURAR EN MS PROJECT</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>8 de octubre de 2026, jueves, Combate de Angamos</li>
            <li>30 de octubre de 2026, viernes, Día de la Canción Criolla</li>
            <li>2 de noviembre de 2026, lunes, Día de Todos los Santos</li>
            <li>8 de diciembre de 2026, martes, Inmaculada Concepción</li>
            <li>25 de diciembre de 2026, viernes, Navidad</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="activity-note">
          <strong>TIPO DE RELACIONES USADAS</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>FI: Fin-Inicio. La predecesora debe terminar para que esta comience.</li>
            <li>II: Inicio-Inicio. Ambas actividades pueden empezar al mismo tiempo.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
       <article class="activity-card">
  <div class="activity-card-header">
    <span class="activity-number">N 1</span>
    <span class="activity-code">1.1</span>
  </div>
  <h4>RESUMEN Gestión del Proyecto</h4>
  <div class="activity-meta">
    <span><strong>Tipo:</strong> Tarea resumen</span>
